Tue Oct 20 05:54:31 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Declare libgcc_s.so.1 + libstdc++.so.6: the payload is installed under
  the auto-requires-excluded /opt/koharu path and both the main koharu
  ELF and the CEF libs DT_NEEDED them (readelf -d on the published
  0.83.5 payload; rpm -qpR had neither, so a minimal system could install
  but fail to load the app). Debian control synced (+libgcc-s1
  +libstdc++6).

Tue Oct 13 18:30:08 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Move CEF bundle from /usr/share/koharu to /opt/koharu (repo convention
  for prebuilt Electron/CEF apps): ELFs under /usr/share trip rpmlint
  E: arch-dependent-file-in-usr-share and aborted the TW build (badness
  3542). Launcher is now a /usr/bin/koharu symlink to /opt/koharu/koharu.
- Ship upstream LICENSE-MIT/LICENSE-APACHE as %license.
- rpmlintrc: drop unused missing-hash-section/shared-library-not-executable
  filters (E: unused-rpmlintrc-filter), add filelist-forbidden-opt.

